  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Feng Jiu Ge asks who goes first at saint regional wall, she and Fairy Ling Mei glance at each other, stand together, and say their manor will take the lead this time. They activate peerless crescent moon slash: its core is rank seven crescent moon Immortal Gu with two rank six Immortal Gu as support, and one Gu Immortal alone cannot display its might. The blue crescent moon cuts about seventy-six steps into the wall before Chen Zhen Chi praises the manor’s well-known killer move. Deeper in, pressure stops them from using that move again, and a thousand steps later the two walk supporting each other.",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_fairy_ling_mei",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_chen_zhen_chi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She wears a white blouse.",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She and Fairy Ling Mei stare with their beautiful eyes wide open.",
      "chapters": [
        924
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She and Fairy Ling Mei of Heaven’s Envy Manor are among those quite heavily injured around Qin Bai Sheng after that fight.",
      "chapters": [
        765
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-injuries-and-movements",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavens_envy_sect",
        "char_qin_bai_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While the Central Continent Gu Immortals hide and watch, Fairy Ling Mei suggests they might as well go to Jade Pool blessed land; Fairy Ao Xue says she has heard a ten thousand li zhi horse ran out there, agreeing with that suggestion.",
      "chapters": [
        811
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-injuries-and-movements",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "loc_jade_pool_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Luo Po Valley she and Fairy Ling Mei cannot match He Lang Zi and Hui Feng Zi’s counterattack and can only retreat.",
      "chapters": [
        886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-injuries-and-movements",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley",
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "char_hui_feng_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She and Fairy Ling Mei control rank seven crescent moon Gu and can unleash peerless crescent moon slash together, a signature famous killer move of Heaven’s Envy Manor. They are hardly ever separated, but at Luo Po Valley limited numbers force them to split while encircling a huge area. During the hundred days battle their combined peerless crescent moon slash injured almost all Shadow Sect Gu Immortals to varying degrees. When Fairy Ling Mei nearly dies, Fairy Ao Xue arrives first in a white blouse, shocked and angry. Mystical light from the valley hits both fairies; they follow Feng Jiu Ge’s call and enter a hidden Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable true inheritance deep in Luo Po Valley.",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luo-po-valley-trap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_crescent_moon_gu",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside that space they ask about the inheritance and hear that only an otherworldly demon can take it. They hold back from attacking when Feng Jiu Ge warns that strikes lengthen the trap, then scream as Qin Bai Sheng’s suicide raises winds of assimilation and activate Gu worms to protect their bodies.",
      "chapters": [
        924
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luo-po-valley-trap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the outer battle, the remaining Central Continent Gu Immortals try to save Feng Jiu Ge, Fairy Ling Mei, and her, confirm the true inheritance, and cannot enter; talk among them notes that if the two fairies die, Heaven’s Envy Manor loses peerless crescent moon slash.",
      "chapters": [
        927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luo-po-valley-trap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, inside Spirit Affinity House, Li Jun Ying states that Heaven’s Envy Manor has sent news of the deaths of Ao Xue and Ling Mei.",
      "chapters": [
        949
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reported-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house",
        "char_li_jun_ying"
      ]
    }
  ],
